msgid "# MS Service Metric"
msgstr "# MS服务指标"

msgid ""
"MS Service Metric collects vLLM Ascend runtime metrics through function "
"hooks and exposes them in Prometheus format. Install `ms_service_metric` "
"separately before using this integration; vLLM Ascend itself does not "
"require it to run inference."
msgstr ""
"MS服务指标通过函数钩子收集vLLM "
"Ascend运行时指标，并以Prometheus格式暴露。使用此集成前需单独安装`ms_service_metric`；vLLM "
"Ascend本身运行推理并不依赖它。"

msgid ""
"For installation, configuration syntax, and complete usage, see the [MS "
"Service Metric "
"documentation](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/msserviceprofiler/blob/master/ms_service_metric/README.md)."
msgstr ""
"有关安装、配置语法和完整用法，请参阅[MS服务指标文档](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/msserviceprofiler/blob/master/ms_service_metric/README.md)。"

msgid "## Basic Usage"
msgstr "## 基本用法"

msgid "Enable metric collection before starting the service:"
msgstr "在启动服务前启用指标收集："

msgid ""
"`PROMETHEUS_MULTIPROC_DIR` stores the Prometheus multiprocess metric files. "
"Use a separate directory for each service instance. Before restarting a "
"service for validation, remove stale files only after confirming that no "
"running service is using the directory."
msgstr ""
"`PROMETHEUS_MULTIPROC_DIR`存储Prometheus多进程指标文件。每个服务实例应使用独立的目录。在重启服务进行验证前，仅在确认没有运行中的服务使用该目录后，才可删除过期文件。"

msgid "After sending inference requests, query the vLLM metrics endpoint:"
msgstr "发送推理请求后，查询vLLM指标端点："

msgid ""
"The output can be scraped by Prometheus and visualized in Grafana. Use `ms-"
"service-metric off` to disable collection."
msgstr "输出可由Prometheus抓取并在Grafana中可视化。使用`ms-service-metric off`可禁用收集。"

msgid "## Custom Metric Configuration"
msgstr "## 自定义指标配置"

msgid ""
"Set `MS_SERVICE_METRIC_CONFIG_PATH` before starting vLLM. It can point to "
"either one YAML file or a directory containing multiple YAML files:"
msgstr ""
"在启动vLLM前设置`MS_SERVICE_METRIC_CONFIG_PATH`。它可以指向单个YAML文件或包含多个YAML文件的目录："

msgid ""
"Directory mode loads first-level `.yaml` and `.yml` files in filename order "
"and does not scan subdirectories recursively. The configured directory is "
"also the root for external Handler modules referenced by `module:function` "
"in these YAML files. Users are responsible for maintaining their custom YAML"
" files and Handler implementations."
msgstr ""
"目录模式按文件名顺序加载第一级`.yaml`和`.yml`文件，不递归扫描子目录。配置的目录也是这些YAML文件中`module:function`引用的外部Handler模块的根目录。用户负责维护其自定义YAML文件和Handler实现。"

msgid ""
"Run `ms-service-metric restart` after changing YAML configuration. Restart "
"the vLLM service after changing Handler Python code because imported Python "
"modules are not reloaded dynamically."
msgstr ""
"更改YAML配置后运行`ms-service-metric restart`。更改Handler "
"Python代码后需重启vLLM服务，因为导入的Python模块不会动态重新加载。"

msgid "## Adding a Metric Point"
msgstr "## 添加指标点"

msgid ""
"vLLM Ascend-owned metric configurations are stored as YAML files in "
"`vllm_ascend/observability/config/`. All YAML files in this directory are "
"loaded automatically."
msgstr ""
"vLLM "
"Ascend自有的指标配置以YAML文件形式存储在`vllm_ascend/observability/config/`中。该目录下的所有YAML文件都会自动加载。"

msgid ""
"1. Identify the target function and add its fully qualified `module:Class.method` name as `symbol`.\n"
"2. Reuse a stable handler from `ms_service_metric.provider_handlers` when it provides the required data processing.\n"
"3. For Ascend-specific processing, add a handler to `vllm_ascend/observability/handlers.py` and reference it as `vllm_ascend.observability.handlers:function_name`.\n"
"4. Add the metric name and Prometheus type under `metrics`, then update `tests/ut/observability/test_ms_metrics_provider.py`."
msgstr ""
"1. 确定目标函数，并将其完全限定的`module:Class.method`名称添加为`symbol`。\n"
"2. 当`ms_service_metric.provider_handlers`提供所需的数据处理时，复用其中的稳定handler。\n"
"3. 对于Ascend特有的处理，在`vllm_ascend/observability/handlers.py`中添加handler，并以`vllm_ascend.observability.handlers:function_name`形式引用。\n"
"4. 在`metrics`下添加指标名称和Prometheus类型，然后更新`tests/ut/observability/test_ms_metrics_provider.py`。"

msgid "Example:"
msgstr "示例："

msgid ""
"Keep configurations and handlers aligned with the vLLM Ascend "
"implementation. A missing symbol disables only the affected metric and must "
"not affect inference."
msgstr "保持配置和handler与vLLM Ascend实现一致。缺失的symbol只会禁用受影响的指标，不得影响推理。"
